diff --git a/readme.md b/readme.md
index 6434792..eed0eb4 100644
--- a/readme.md
+++ b/readme.md
@@ -154,6 +154,18 @@ Default: `false`
 Reject pending promises with an `AbortError` when `clearQueue()` is called.
 This is recommended if you await the returned promises, for example with `Promise.all`, so pending tasks do not remain unresolved after `clearQueue()`.
 
+### limitedFunction.activeCount
+
+The number of promises currently running for this function.
+
+### limitedFunction.pendingCount
+
+The number of calls waiting to run for this function.
+
+### limitedFunction.concurrency
+
+Get or set the concurrency limit for this function. Increasing the limit immediately allows queued calls to run.
+
 ### limitedFunction.clearQueue()
 
 Discard pending calls that have not started yet.
